" end="02:36.082">う</span><span begin="02:36.082" end="02:36.466">事</span><span begin="02:36.466" end="02:36.607">が</span><span begin="02:36.607" end="02:36.748">あ</span><span begin="02:36.749" end="02:36.890">っ</span><span begin="02:36.890" end="02:37.066">て</span><span begin="02:37.066" end="02:37.234">も</span><span begin="02:37.234" end="02:37.570">君</span><span begin="02:37.570" end="02:37.738">に</span><span begin="02:37.738" end="02:38.346">大丈夫</span><span begin="02:38.346" end="02:38.474">っ</span><span begin="02:38.474" end="02:38.689">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">哪怕有心事 那句对能你说</span></p><p begin="02:38.689" end="02:41.445" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="02:38.689" end="02:38.841">言</span><span begin="02:38.841" end="02:39.121">う</span><span begin="02:39.121" end="02:39.689">権利</span><span begin="02:39.689" end="02:40.001">だ</span><span begin="02:40.001" end="02:40.257">け</span><span begin="02:40.257" end="02:40.857">私</span><span begin="02:40.857" end="02:41.065">に</span><span begin="02:41.065" end="02:41.201">ほ</span><span begin="02:41.201" end="02:41.357">し</span><span begin="02:41.357" end="02:41.445">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">没关系的权力 也请留给我</span></p><p begin="02:41.445" end="02:43.481" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37"><span begin="02:41.445" end="02:41.621">そ</span><span begin="02:41.621" end="02:41.789">れ</span><span begin="02:41.789" end="02:41.957">だ</span><span begin="02:41.957" end="02:42.117">け</span><span begin="02:42.117" end="02:42.325">も</span><span begin="02:42.325" end="02:42.525">た</span><span begin="02:42.525" end="02:42.725">せ</span><span begin="02:42.725" end="02:42.893">て</span><span begin="02:42.893" end="02:43.141">ほ</span><span begin="02:43.141" end="02:43.269">し</span><span begin="02:43.269" end="02:43.481">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">只求能有这样的权力</span></p><p begin="02:43.481" end="02:46.368" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38"><span begin="02:43.481" end="02:43.677">こ</span><span begin="02:43.677" end="02:43.873">ん</span><span begin="02:43.873" end="02:44.217">な</span><span begin="02:44.449" end="02:44.873">重</span><span begin="02:44.873" end="02:45.218">い</span><span begin="02:45.497" end="02:45.921">の</span><span begin="02:45.921" end="02:46.368">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">分明倍感沉重</span></p><p begin="02:46.368" end="02:51.705" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39"><span begin="02:46.368" end="02:46.608">や</span><span begin="02:46.608" end="02:46.944">め</span><span begin="02:46.944" end="02:47.240">と</span><span begin="02:47.240" end="02:47.386">こ</span><span begin="02:47.387" end="02:47.533">う</span><span begin="02:47.533" end="02:47.679">っ</span><span begin="02:47.680" end="02:47.976">て</span><span begin="02:47.976" end="02:48.296">思</span><span begin="02:48.296" end="02:48.418">っ</span><span begin="02:48.418" end="02:49.194">て</span><span begin="02:49.194" end="02:50.946">た</span><span begin="02:50.946" end="02:51.202">の</span><span begin="02:51.202" end="02:51.705">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">已经想着要放弃了</span></p><p begin="02:53.788" end="02:58.533" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40"><span begin="02:53.788" end="02:54.380">喉</span><span begin="02:54.380" end="02:54.732">が</span><span begin="02:54.732" end="02:55.228">渇</span><span begin="02:55.228" end="02:55.477">い</span><span begin="02:55.477" end="02:55.660">た</span><span begin="02:55.660" end="02:55.989">ら</span> <span begin="02:56.276" end="02:56.964">教</span><span begin="02:56.964" end="02:57.324">え</span><span begin="02:57.324" end="02:57.508">て</span><span begin="02:57.508" end="02:57.836">あ</span><span begin="02:57.836" end="02:58.108">げ</span><span begin="02:58.108" end="02:58.260">る</span><span begin="02:58.260" end="02:58.533">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">要是喉咙渴了 让我教教你</span></p><p begin="02:58.740" end="03:00.894" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41"><span begin="02:58.740"