"v1" itunes:key="L44"><span begin="03:06.452" end="03:06.628">そ</span><span begin="03:06.628" end="03:06.804">ん</span><span begin="03:06.804" end="03:07.139">な</span><span begin="03:07.139" end="03:07.563">事</span><span begin="03:07.563" end="03:07.684">な</span><span begin="03:07.684" end="03:07.828">か</span><span begin="03:07.828" end="03:07.972">っ</span><span begin="03:07.972" end="03:08.308">た</span><span begin="03:08.308" end="03:08.652">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">仿佛无懈可击</span></p><p begin="03:08.884" end="03:11.372" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45"><span begin="03:08.884" end="03:09.273">装</span><span begin="03:09.273" end="03:09.379">う</span><span begin="03:09.380" end="03:09.548">こ</span><span begin="03:09.548" end="03:09.692">と</span><span begin="03:09.692" end="03:09.908">に</span><span begin="03:09.908" end="03:10.084">は</span><span begin="03:10.084" end="03:10.604">成功</span><span begin="03:10.604" end="03:10.796">し</span><span begin="03:10.796" end="03:10.980">た</span><span begin="03:10.980" end="03:11.164">っ</span><span begin="03:11.164" end="03:11.372">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">明明虚饰伪装已经成功</span></p><p begin="03:11.372" end="03:14.141" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46"><span begin="03:11.372" end="03:11.764">君</span><span begin="03:11.764" end="03:11.948">の</span><span begin="03:11.948" end="03:12.459">調子</span><span begin="03:12.459" end="03:12.651">に</span><span begin="03:12.651" end="03:12.852">の</span><span begin="03:12.852" end="03:13.036">ま</span><span begin="03:13.036" end="03:13.310">れ</span><span begin="03:13.310" end="03:13.485">て</span><span begin="03:13.485" end="03:13.653">し</span><span begin="03:13.653" end="03:13.797">ま</span><span begin="03:13.797" end="03:13.894">い</span><span begin="03:13.894" end="03:14.017">そ</span><span begin="03:14.018" end="03:14.141">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">却好似被你的节奏吞噬而去</span></p></div></body></tt>